WoWFA_En[257044] = "Shoot a stream of $s1 shots at your target over $d, dealing a total of ${$m1*$257045sw1} Physical damage. Usable while moving.\n\n|cFFFFFFFFEach shot generates $263585s1 Focus.|r"
